@segment  ocean
@title    Ocean Surf — Energy Framing
@levels   F10
@duration ~2m

say Now, listen to the sound of the ocean surf. This is more than relaxation. This is energy.
pause 8
say A natural rhythm. A wave of motion and stillness, always present where sea meets the land.
pause 6
say You are made of similar waves. Your heart pulses in rhythmic bursts, and you breathe in soft, rising arcs. My voice reaches you through invisible vibrations that your ears translate into meaning.
pause 6
say All of this is energy. It flows through you constantly, often without your awareness. But from this moment on, you're learning how to feel it, shape it, and use it deliberately.
pause 5
say This is not something foreign or dangerous. It is your own life energy. It belongs to you, and no one else.
pause 6
